<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Nan Ya Jan-Sept profit down.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Nan Ya Jan-Sept profit down.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>		(in million Taiwan $ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				65,013 vs 68,463</p>
<p>    pretax profit			  5,907 vs  6,813</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5,150 vs  5,753</p>
<p>Note - Nan Ya Plastics Corp is Taiwan's largest industrial firm and a key member of the Formosa Plastics Group.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
